> Controls, scope and capture

Consecutive bb collapses under the actual forward duplicate check, while cc
keeps its exception. Inserting punctuation can change context despite emitting
no symbol: b-b and m-b need not behave like bb and mb. Catherine and Kathryn
retain their original equal native keys, demonstrating one useful grouping
without establishing general homophone recognition.

Normalization here is byte ctype case conversion under the active C locale. It
is not Unicode normalization or accent transliteration. Spaces have a native
output/context rule and unhandled bytes remain context positions. The library
preserves its existing ordinary outputs and makes those limitations explicit
rather than silently substituting another variant’s encoder.

Each iteration consumes at least one input byte and emits at most two, so
time/storage are O(N). Complete capture counts original bytes, actual normalized
bytes, one actual step record per iteration, its actual emitted suffix bytes and
final key bytes. Default logical cap is one million; zero disables it.
Rule-label characters, record fields, capacities, runtime copies and bytes are
not separately counted. Capture copies are admitted after the actual branch is
known; the quota is not a runtime bound. Failure returns no partial trace.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/metaphone_controls.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/metaphone.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/plot.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
int main() {
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    std::vector<std::string> inputs{"bb", "cc", "b-b", "mb", "m-b", "Catherine",
                                    "Kathryn"};
    std::vector<double> x, keybytes;
    std::print("| prescribed control | actual native key | actual normalized bytes | actual consumed bytes " "| actual rule iterations | actual emitted bytes | captured entries |\n| --- | --- | ---: | " "---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (std::size_t i = 0; i < inputs.size(); ++i) {
        auto t = dm::algorithms::metaphone_trace(inputs[i]);
        auto &a = t.analysis;
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", inputs[i], a.key,
                   a.normalized.size(), a.consumed, a.iterations, a.emitted,
                   t.captured_entries);
        x.push_back(i);
        keybytes.push_back(a.key.size());
    }
    auto p = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
    p.points(x, keybytes, "actual native key bytes");
    p.x_label("prescribed control index in table order").y_label(
        "actual emitted key bytes").title("Actual duplicate, punctuation and spelling controls").save_svg("build/metaphone_controls.svg");
}
```
