| cc | KK | 2 | 2 | 2 | 2 | 10 |
| b-b | BB | 3 | 3 | 3 | 2 | 13 |
| mb | M | 2 | 2 | 2 | 1 | 8 |
| m-b | MB | 3 | 3 | 3 | 2 | 13 |
| Catherine | K0RN | 9 | 9 | 8 | 4 | 34 |
| Kathryn | K0RN | 7 | 7 | 6 | 4 | 28 |
